"Usager petit-déjeuner St. Leu"},{"id":3124422,"name":"Blandine Bidault","role":"Bénévole petit-déjeuner St. Leu"},{"id":78466,"name":"Claus Drexel","role":"Touriste bavarois","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s9AUqAwZW1q7FnVQya56WLyXbAH.jpg"},{"id":3124423,"name":"Géraldine Drexel","role":"Touriste bavaroise"},{"id":2200706,"name":"Kamel Benchemekh","role":"Passant La Chapelle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bFRDCBNTsTZnSP9MmwX4tg9RBCu.jpg"},{"id":3124424,"name":"Nouche Juglet-Marcus","role":"Passant La Chapelle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jodSmaKmRWJ6QaNeSkW6KROLFLu.jpg"},{"id":3124426,"name":"Alexis Mukenge","role":"Passant La Chapelle"},{"id":3124427,"name":"David Contaret","role":"SDF rigolo CDG"},{"id":3124428,"name":"David Garbay","role":"Vendeur de bonnet"},{"id":3124429,"name":"Barbara Canale","role":"La passante providentielle","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wbIjzECNql8lzH2TRn0RgeLegtT.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Sotto le stelle di Parigi","overview":"La vita di Christine non è stata facile ultimamente. La sua routine solitaria è divisa tra la distribuzione gratuita di banchi alimentari e il vagabondaggio per le strade. In una fredda notte d'inverno trova Suli, un bambino eritreo di 8 anni, che singhiozza davanti al suo rifugio. Christine capisce che si è perso ed è stato separato da sua madre. Vincolati dalla loro condizione marginale, intraprendono insieme un viaggio emozionante per trovare la madre di Suli nel mondo sotterraneo di Parigi..."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Under the Stars of Paris","overview":"Christine’s life has not been easy lately. Her lonely routine is divided between free food banks distributions and wandering the streets. On a cold winter night she founds Suli, an 8-year-old Eritrean boy, sobbing in front of her shelter. Christine understands that he is lost and has been separated from his mother. Bounded by their marginal condition, they embark together on an emotional journey to find Suli’s mother in the underground world of Paris..."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Depuis de nombreuses années, Christine vit sous un pont, isolée de toute famille et amis. Par une nuit comme il n’en existe que dans les contes, un jeune garçon de huit ans fait irruption devant son abri. Suli ne parle pas français, il est perdu, séparé de sa mère... Ensemble, ils partent à sa recherche. À travers les rues de Paris, Christine et Suli vont apprendre à se connaître et à s’apprivoiser. Et Christine à retrouver une humanité qu’elle croyait disparue.","tagline":"Jusqu'où iriez-vous pour l'amour d'un enfant ?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jenJTofBZU2n42iciDlDQNaYFaO.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nUOhm94Qz9SPJozytJgF8iZyArs.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":575293,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jenJTofBZU2n42iciDlDQNaYFaO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jenJTofBZU2n42iciDlDQNaYFaO.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jenJTofBZU2n42iciDlDQNaYFaO.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jenJTofBZU2n42iciDlDQNaYFaO.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/obziP53V5cVNTQpi9JffGiIfggn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/obziP53V5cVNTQpi9JffGiIfggn.jpg","language":"fr","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/obziP53V5cVNTQpi9JffGiIfggn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://im